{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>陳自瑤（Yoyo）向來保養得宜，其凍齡外貌與姣好身材一直被網民封為「女神」。近日，陳自瑤受邀前往澳洲參與慈善活動並人氣高企，除了即場獻唱外更拎出私人珍藏進行拍賣。工作之餘，她亦抓緊時間感受當地風土人情，並於社交平台大晒一組在當地景點拍攝的唯美花絮靚相。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_ea93b7c44635fc5a-375\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>從相片中可見，陳自瑤身處悉尼海濱打卡影靚相，身穿一襲粉紅色黑波點掛頸吊帶長裙，外搭一件淡藍色牛仔外套。Yoyo大玩隨性性感，特意將牛仔外套半拉滑落至手臂，大方露出光滑白皙的香肩與美背，狀態極佳。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_ea93b7c44635fc5a-375\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7817b080-97a9-465f-b905-365985ce0dee.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026dodmyM6JYp1789525533.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7817b080-97a9-465f-b905-365985ce0dee.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f7598f36-10d1-4e04-9e75-fe3e33b0aa76.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Sa5ooMQJWF1789525533.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f7598f36-10d1-4e04-9e75-fe3e33b0aa76.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fa0b0359-e1a5-480b-9a82-351e75dbfae4.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026RnsrTja7Vv1789525532.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fa0b0359-e1a5-480b-9a82-351e75dbfae4.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_ea93b7c44635fc5a-376\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>陳自瑤隨後感性留言回味這趟難得的旅程，寫道：「記得上次來澳洲已經差不多是20年前😝🤭 感恩這次再給我機會踏足這座美麗的城市🚢 和感受大家的熱情🥰 我已經開始掛住呢度啦 希望好快有機會再返黎！🤍」字裡行間盡顯對當地的依依不舍。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T02:39:44.951013+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}